Z||000000||Monkeyman||09-20-2001||06:34 PM||||Can anyone think of any reasons why it would be a bad idea to mount the stereo (DIN size) where the overhead light console is?  I have a sunroof, I know that it will physically fit if I make my own pod, and I'll still be able to see the display.  Any reason why I couldn't cut away the small hump at the rear (sunroof side) of the light console (on the headliner).<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/PontiacAPE.jpg">    <BR>Monkeyman||||reg||5
Z||000001||fierosound||09-20-2001||07:54 PM||||Your CD player will skip.  The roof structure will shake, especially if you have a stiff lowered suspension.||||reg||10
